33
00:02:21.856 --> 00:02:22.940
I can't.

34
00:02:24.483 --> 00:02:25.567
No.

35
00:02:25.568 --> 00:02:26.569
You sure?

36
00:02:27.319 --> 00:02:30.281
Yeah. I've been chasing Priscilla.
but I've been watching you.

37
00:02:31.198 --> 00:02:33.367
And all your life. you've been…

38
00:02:34.076 --> 00:02:35.202
[sighs]

39
00:02:37.079 --> 00:02:39.290
