40
00:02:40.416 --> 00:02:43.544
This is an opportunity for you
to get out of this shit.

41
00:02:44.086 --> 00:02:46.130
To play with a fresh deck.

42
00:02:46.672 --> 00:02:48.090
What about Cary?

43
00:02:49.842 --> 00:02:51.594
Depends on how deep he goes.

44
00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:55.765
Full immunity.

45
00:02:57.516 --> 00:03:00.102
