48
00:03:11.322 --> 00:03:12.323
So do you.

49
00:03:17.453 --> 00:03:19.455
{\an8}[theme song playing]

50
00:04:47.668 --> 00:04:48.836
You're alive.

51
00:04:54.592 --> 00:04:55.593
Good for you.

52
00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:57.969
- Lucky.
- Give me the seed phrase.

53
00:04:57.970 --> 00:04:59.596
Lucky. you gotta listen to me.

54
00:04:59.597 --> 00:05:02.767
No. The seed phrase. Please.

55
00:05:03.934 --> 00:05:06.394
Lucky.
Listen. I need to explain. all right?

56
00:05:06.395 --> 00:05:07.937
Can I… Can I… Can I explain?

57
00:05:07.938 --> 00:05:09.231
Don't!

58
00:05:09.815 --> 00:05:11.149
[groans]

59
00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:12.151
