60
00:05:12.735 --> 00:05:13.986
[breathes shakily]

61
00:05:28.417 --> 00:05:30.669
No. I don't want your fucking ice.

62
00:05:40.346 --> 00:05:43.932
Sorry. I knew you would find me.
I just didn't think it would be this soon.

63
00:05:43.933 --> 00:05:46.684
[chuckles] I think we're
experiencing time a little differently.

64
00:05:46.685 --> 00:05:48.394
Okay. well. whatever happened. I'm sorry.

65
00:05:48.395 --> 00:05:49.646
I understand. okay?

66
00:05:49.647 --> 00:05:51.231
What? Don't… Don't do that.

67
00:05:51.232 --> 00:05:52.857
- No.
- What?

68
00:05:52.858 --> 00:05:55.360
Don't do the thing that you do
where you try and appease me

69
00:05:55.361 --> 00:05:56.861
before you even know
what the fuck you did.

70
00:05:56.862 --> 00:05:58.738
- I know what the fuck I did.
- Oh. no. you don't.

71
00:05:58.739 --> 00:06:01.449
- Lucky…
- You made me a fucking mark. Cary!

72
00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:03.326
- No. that's not what happened.
- Bullshit!

73
00:06:03.327 --> 00:06:04.994
- I didn't have a choice.
- Bullshit again!

74
00:06:04.995 --> 00:06:06.079
Can I explain myself?

75
00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:07.163
No. I don't wanna hear it.

76
00:06:07.164 --> 00:06:09.082
I know you don't.
but I think you fucking need to right now.

77
00:06:09.083 --> 00:06:11.292
No. I know you've had as much time
to rehearse for this moment

78
00:06:11.293 --> 00:06:12.377
