79
00:06:12.378 --> 00:06:14.838
So I am sure you've
got a great story loaded up

80
00:06:14.839 --> 00:06:16.297
and ready to go. but I really don't want...

81
00:06:16.298 --> 00:06:17.507
I will hit you again!

82
00:06:17.508 --> 00:06:19.385
Okay. Fuck.

83
00:06:22.138 --> 00:06:24.432
Maybe go for a softer area this time.

84
00:06:25.224 --> 00:06:28.685
Are you seriously trying
to be fucking charming right now?

85
00:06:28.686 --> 00:06:30.186
I'm not. This is hard for me too. okay?

86
00:06:30.187 --> 00:06:32.439
Of course. this is hard for you.

87
00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:34.190
Yes. let's make this about you…

88
00:06:34.191 --> 00:06:36.109
- That's not what I meant.
- …and your obvious misery.

89
00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:37.778
I was terrified. Cary.

90
00:06:38.279 --> 00:06:41.364
Okay? I didn't know
whether I had to be hating you

91
00:06:41.365 --> 00:06:44.868
