or fucking somehow saving you.

92
00:06:44.869 --> 00:06:46.537
- I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
- Don't!

93
00:06:48.122 --> 00:06:49.831
You know. at first. I thought that maybe

94
00:06:49.832 --> 00:06:51.541
