to both of us. right?

95
00:06:51.542 --> 00:06:55.170
Like maybe we were both drugged.
and you were hurt or worse.

96
00:06:55.171 --> 00:06:58.381
and I was gonna have to spend the rest of
my life never knowing what had happened.

97
00:06:58.382 --> 00:06:59.632
But after a while. I realized

98
00:06:59.633 --> 00:07:02.010
