that I could actually accept

99
00:07:02.011 --> 00:07:03.679
was that you were dead.

100
00:07:04.305 --> 00:07:07.265
Because at least if you were dead then
that means that you did not do this to me.

101
00:07:07.266 --> 00:07:10.059
But here you are alive and well
in a fucking beach house.

102
00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:11.353
and you did do this to me.

103
00:07:12.897 --> 00:07:16.566
[Rand] We've got a hit on the plates and
IDed Masterson at the house in La Jolla.

104
00:07:16.567 --> 00:07:18.443
We've got local cops moving in.

105
00:07:18.444 --> 00:07:21.404
