in the area.

106
00:07:21.405 --> 00:07:24.324
[dispatcher] <i>All available units.
report back to the station</i>

107
00:07:24.325 --> 00:07:26.367
<i>to assist an FBI fugitive task force.</i>

108
00:07:26.368 --> 00:07:28.120
<i>Please indicate then switch to four.</i>

109
00:07:28.913 --> 00:07:31.290
Fugitive task force?
Do you think that's him?

110
00:07:31.916 --> 00:07:33.959
- We'll know soon enough.
- [sighs]

111
00:07:34.502 --> 00:07:35.711
What a mess.

112
00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:38.172
We've cleaned up worse.

113
00:07:39.548 --> 00:07:41.091
Remember Temple City?

114
00:07:41.092 --> 00:07:43.344
Oh. God. I think I blocked that.

115
00:07:43.886 --> 00:07:45.930
